values ('a7c3e1d4-8b26-4f05-9c18-5d2e0a9b6f31', 'nursing-research-and-evidence-based-practice', 'Nursing Research and Evidence-Based Practice', 'This integrated course develops the knowledge, judgment, and practical skills nurses need to ask answerable clinical questions, find and critically appraise research, integrate evidence with clinical expertise and patient values, and lead ethical, equitable improvements in care. BSN learners build confident research literacy and contribute to evidence-based change; MSN learners additionally evaluate complex bodies of evidence, select implementation strategies, measure outcomes, and lead dissemination.');

